{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vsdpaDJ8Xz1793447235.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大灣區首個郵輪公海遊試點航線昨日啟航。</p><p></p><p>這艘「夢想」號郵輪，從深圳蛇口國際郵輪母港出發，中途不停靠任何港口，在距離中國領海基線約24公里海域完成3日2夜行程後，將原港返航，全程無需簽證，內地遊客有護照即可登船。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.TOURISM-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260LfOGaXnXz1793447243.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>今次航程共售出至少2,000張船票。是繼上海、天津後，內地第三個「無目的地海上遊」，即香港所講的「公海遊」試點港口。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:37.131344+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.797689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.711019+00:00","content_hash":"1acc6544a12e30fde2907c6d2e2cff919fdd45daff719fbe75f9fbc610a33517","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:37.131344+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}